This is an AI powered customer support chat bot. Made for the Alpha Networks internship program.

# Technologies used:
- Tensorflow to fine tune the models
- Intent classification model: DistilBERT
- Response generation model: FlanT5
- Backend API: Flask
- Frontend: HTML, CSS, JS

(The dataset was synthetically created and expanded using generative AI)

# How to run:
- Clone this git repository
- Install requirements.txt
- Run the jupyter notebooks in the models folder to compile the models
- Run the Flask app in main.py
- Go to localhost:5000

